invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: handle_ticket hands on_ticket a ticket whose ticket_lifetime is 0,
  which RFC 9846 section 4.6.1 says to discard at once. A caller that
  copies that lifetime into ch_cfg.ticket_lifetime_s gives 0, which reads
  as no lifetime, and the ticket is offered for seven days. The row with a
  lifetime of 0 requires no on_ticket call.

--- old
    if (t->cfg.on_ticket == NULL || ticket.lifetime_s == 0 || nonce_len > SHA256_LEN ||
--- new
    if (t->cfg.on_ticket == NULL || nonce_len > SHA256_LEN ||
